{"id":"b7212f0a8db1c2a3","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-polynomial-proof.md","title":"Polynomial Proof","display":"df-polynomial-proof — Polynomial Proof","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-polynomial-proof","aliases":["72-df-polynomial-proof"],"display":"df-polynomial-proof — Polynomial Proof","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, sections 2.1, 2.3 and Theorem 2.1.1; printed pp. 550-551; PDF pp. 562-563","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-polynomial-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-polynomial-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-proof — Polynomial Proof"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, sections 2.1, 2.3 and Theorem 2.1.1; printed pp. 550-551; PDF pp. 562-563"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(F)\">\\(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(F)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N[X]\">\\(\\mathbb N[X]\\)</span> 为非负整数系数多项式集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\pi|,|\\tau|\">\\(|\\pi|,|\\tau|\\)</span> 为二进制串长。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(F(\\pi)=\\tau\\land|\\pi|\\leq p(|\\tau|)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(F(\\pi)=\\tau\\land|\\pi|\\leq p(|\\tau|)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_F(\\tau)=\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\land F(\\pi)=\\tau\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_F(\\tau)=\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\land F(\\pi)=\\tau\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Short}_{F,p}(\\tau)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;s_F(\\tau)\\leq p(|\\tau|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Short}_{F,p}(\\tau)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;s_F(\\tau)\\leq p(|\\tau|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，§2.1 及 Theorem 2.1.1，印刷页 550，PDF 页 562；最短大小记号见 §2.3，印刷页 551，PDF 页 563。</li>\n<li>Polynomial boundedness quantifies only over tautologies. Requiring proofs for all formulas would contradict soundness.</li>\n<li>The bounding polynomial is explicit in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Short}_{F,p}\">\\(\\operatorname{Short}_{F,p}\\)</span> and existentially quantified only in the system-level predicate. 满射条件保证最小值所在集合非空；自然数良序性保证最小值存在。</li>\n<li>删除了仅作名称提示的通用 proof-complexity 依赖，统一使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span> 的字符串类型；本次核对定义陈述，没有借此断言某个强证明系统多项式有界。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(F)$，$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$\\mathrm{TAUT}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TAUT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathbb N[X]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N[X]","display":false},{"tex":"|\\pi|,|\\tau|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(F(\\pi)=\\tau\\land|\\pi|\\leq p(|\\tau|)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"s_F(\\tau)=\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\land F(\\pi)=\\tau\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Short}_{F,p}(\\tau)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;s_F(\\tau)\\leq p(|\\tau|).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Short}_{F,p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TAUT}","display":false}],"bytes":2054,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-390","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-polynomial-proof|df-polynomial-proof — Polynomial Proof]]"},{"id":"f71e8ee2e0f13d03","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]；$\\operatorname{PolyBounded}$ 如 [[72-df-polynomial-proof]]。"},{"id":"76c43204ed5ebccb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"P 满足 PropProofSystem；PolyBounded 取 [[72-df-polynomial-proof]]，Optimal 与模拟方向取 [[72-df-optimal-proof-system]]。"},{"id":"37a60b204014a7b1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8f199facc63aa2aa","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9269f9c4fc3715b6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PropProofSystem},\\mathrm{TAUT}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]；$s_P$ 如 [[72-df-polynomial-proof]]。"}],"outgoing":["d9d13f2ac55f5a6d"]}